Directions: For this part, you are allowed 30 minutes to write a short essay on **the phenomenon of young people staying up late**. You should start your essay with a brief 
description of the situation and then express your views on it. You should write at least 120 words but no more than 180 words.


###
	Nowadays, that young people stay up late have become a common phenomenon. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, staying up late is harming students in a
hidden way.
	For one thing, it may bring healthy issues to students. Plenty of students ususally change their sleeping time, which will bring many body issues to them.For examples, they may 
be gradually hard to fall asleep at night and have headache at morning. For another, it have a negative fluence on learning.Once they get addicted to stay up late, they may fell
tired at the lesson and be hard to think about questions.
	From my perspective, students should have a good sleeping habit. Only in this way can they be full of energy and boost their concentration.   


### 逐处错误标注
1. that young people stay up late → staying up late among young people；主语从句此处生硬，动名词短语更适合四级写作
2. have become → has become；动名词作主语，谓语动词用单数
3. healthy issues → health problems；healthy 是形容词，此处需要名词 health 作定语
4. ususally → usually（拼写错误）
5. sleeping time → sleep schedule；更地道表达作息
6. For examples → For example；固定短语无复数
7. have headache → suffer from headaches；固定搭配，headache 可数
8. at morning → in the morning；固定介词搭配
9. it have → it has；it 为单数主语，谓语用 has
10. fluence → influence（拼写错误）
11. addicted to stay → addicted to staying；to 是介词，后面接动名词
12. fell → feel（拼写错误）
13. at the lesson → in class；地道表达：在课堂上
14. boost their concentration → improve their concentration；improve 搭配更自然


### 修正版
  Nowadays, staying up late among young people has become a common phenomenon. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, staying up late harms young people 
in a hidden way.
  For one thing, it may bring health problems to them. Many young people often change their sleep schedule, which causes various physical troubles. For example, they may find it 
difficult to fall asleep at night and suffer from headaches in the morning. For another, it has a negative influence on study.Once they get addicted to staying up late, they may
feel tired in class and struggle to think clearly.
  From my perspective, young people should develop good sleeping habits. Only in this way can they be full of energy and improve their concentration.


### 优化完整版（146 词，四级高分）
  Nowadays, staying up late among young people has become a common phenomenon. Opinions vary from person to person. As far as I am concerned, staying up late does great harm to 
young people in an invisible way.
  For one thing, irregular sleep will damage their physical health. If young people keep staying up late, they are likely to have sleep disorders and frequent headaches. For 
another, this bad habit affects their academic performance. Lacking enough rest, they will feel sleepy and absent-minded during classes.
  From my perspective, young people should form regular sleeping habits. Only in this way can they keep energetic and maintain high learning efficiency.
